# Customer Ledger APIs

### Base URL

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@access_token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0b2tlbl90eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIiwiZXhwIjoxNzkwNTk3ODQ5LCJpYXQiOjE3OTA1NjkwNDksImp0aSI6IjM5ZWFmMWVjNDVlMDQyMjU5MzllMWY3Y2ZmZGViYjc4IiwidXNlcl9pZCI6MiwiaXNfc3VwZXJhZG1pbiI6ZmFsc2UsImlzX2hyX2FkbWluIjp0cnVlLCJpc19lbXBsb3llZSI6ZmFsc2UsImlzX2hyIjpmYWxzZX0.ZhXD2DLAgyw0f7rvekJQAMVEqmJH6-oJFrDx0bX7Se4
@customer_id = CUSTOMER_ID




### 1. List All Ledger Entries

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/ledger/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json



### 2. Get Customer Ledger

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/finance/ledger/customer/4/
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json


---

### 3. Get Customer Ledger with Date Filter


GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/ledger/customer/4/?from_date=2026-09-01&to_date=2026-09-30
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json


---

### 4. Filter by Transaction Type — Invoice


GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/ledger/customer/1/?transaction_type=invoice
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

---

### 5. Filter by Transaction Type — Payment

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/ledger/customer/4/?transaction_type=invoice
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json


---

### 6. Filter by Transaction Type — Opening Balance


GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/ledger/customer/{{customer_id}}/?transaction_type=opening_balance
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json


---

### 7. Search Ledger


GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/ledger/?search=SEARCH_VALUE
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json


---

### 8. Order Ledger — Oldest First


GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/ledger/?ordering=transaction_date
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

---

### 9. Order Ledger — Newest First


GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/ledger/?ordering=-transaction_date
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json


---

### 10. Customer Ledger Summary

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/ledger/summary/?customer_id=4
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json


---

### 11. Customer Ledger Summary with Date Filter


GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/ledger/summary/?customer_id={{customer_id}}&from_date=2026-09-01&to_date=2026-09-30
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json


---

## 12. Customer Ledger — Date + Transaction Type

```http
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/ledger/customer/{{customer_id}}/?from_date=2026-09-01&to_date=2026-09-30&transaction_type=invoice
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
```

---

### 13. Customer Ledger — Date + Search


GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/ledger/customer/{{customer_id}}/?from_date=2026-09-01&to_date=2026-09-30&search=INV001
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json


---

## 14. Customer Ledger — Pagination

```http
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/ledger/customer/{{customer_id}}/?page=1&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
```
### Create Customer Ledger - Debit
POST http://localhost:8000/api/finance/ledger/
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0b2tlbl90eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIiwiZXhwIjoxNzkwNTk3ODQ5LCJpYXQiOjE3OTA1NjkwNDksImp0aSI6IjM5ZWFmMWVjNDVlMDQyMjU5MzllMWY3Y2ZmZGViYjc4IiwidXNlcl9pZCI6MiwiaXNfc3VwZXJhZG1pbiI6ZmFsc2UsImlzX2hyX2FkbWluIjp0cnVlLCJpc19lbXBsb3llZSI6ZmFsc2UsImlzX2hyIjpmYWxzZX0.ZhXD2DLAgyw0f7rvekJQAMVEqmJH6-oJFrDx0bX7Se4
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customer": 1,
    "transaction_date": "2026-09-22",
    "reference_number": "REF-10025",
    "description": "Manual debit adjustment",
    "mode": "debit",
    "amount": "500.00"
}


